  "body": "Wording fixes from the #682 review.\n\n- **AGENTS.md fork rule:** \"never into the fork's `main`\" now says process files are the one exception, so it no longer contradicts the next point.\n- **AGENTS.md cut step 2:** the dash aside about the release notes' \"Process changes\" section is now a plain sentence. The commit text is unchanged.\n- **`.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`:** 1 to 2.\n\nDocs and process only. Merged directly on the maintainer's instruction.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
